⍝ AllPrimitives.tc
⍝ ════════════════

∇ON_ERROR ARGS;N;A;B;X;OPER;FH;LINES;TS;NAME;FMT
 ⍝ write /tmp/ALL_PRIMITIVES_ERROR_N.apl: a self-contained script that
 ⍝ reconstructs A, B, X (via 10 ⎕CR) and then executes OPER, so the
 ⍝ failure captured in ARGS←(N A B X OPER) can be reproduced later.
 ⍝
 (N A B X OPER)←ARGS
 NAME←'/tmp/ALL_PRIMITIVES_ERROR_',(⍕N),'.apl'
 FH←'w' ⎕FIO.fopen NAME
 FMT←'%s',(⎕UCS 10)
 TS←⎕TS
 ⊣((⊂FMT),⊂'⍝ ',(⍕TS[1]),'-',(⍕TS[2]),'-',(⍕TS[3]),' ',(⍕TS[4]),':',(⍕TS[5]),':',(⍕TS[6])) ⎕FIO.fprintf FH
 LINES←(10⎕CR 'A'),(10⎕CR 'B'),(10⎕CR 'X'),⊂OPER
 ⊣{⊣((⊂FMT),⊂⍵) ⎕FIO.fprintf FH}¨LINES
 ⊣⎕FIO.fclose FH
∇

∇Z←ALL_PRIMITIVES B; ⎕IO;T0;PRIM;TD;RE;A;B;X;ROW;OPER;EXPD;RC;ET;RES;LCNT;ECNT;RC2;ET2;RES2;SEED
 ⍝ run for B seconds
 ⍝
 ⍝ TODO: A/B/X are currently generated independently, so most draws are
 ⍝ shape-non-conforming and fail in OPER before EXPD is ever exercised
 ⍝ (e.g. A+B needs ⍴A≡⍴B or one of A,B scalar, recursively if nested).
 ⍝ Conforming them per-primitive is 6 ⎕RVAL's job, not this function's —
 ⍝ needs a new conforming generator (C++ in Quad_RVAL, or an APL helper).
 ⍝
 SEED←(8⍴256)⊤((⎕TS[3]-1)×24×60×60×1000)+24 60 60 1000⊥⎕TS[4 5 6 7]
 ⊣0 ⎕RVAL SEED       ⍝ seed from current time so different runs differ
 RE←100              ⍝ desired ⍴∈ limit (was 10000; ⎕RVAL nesting budget blows up, see TODO)
 TD ← 15 70 15 5 5   ⍝ desired type distribution
 PRIM←6 ⎕RVAL ⍬
 T0←24 60 60⊥⎕TS[4 5 6]
 LCNT←0              ⍝ number of loop iterations so far
 ECNT←0              ⍝ number of ERROR: exits so far
LOOP:
 LCNT←LCNT+1
 ⊣⎕DL 0.1   ⍝ rate limit (unconditional: caps load on server72 every iteration)
 ROW←PRIM[?≢PRIM;]   ⍝ pick a random primitive: arity A_stim B_stim X_stim Z_constraint
 (A B X)←{⎕RVAL⍣(0<≢⍵)⊢⍵}¨⍎¨ROW[2 3 4]   ⍝ ⍬ stim (unused arg) stays ⍬, else ⎕RVAL it
 (OPER EXPD)←ROW[1 5]   ⍝ arity expression (e.g. Z←A+B) and Z constraint
 (RC ET RES)←⎕EC OPER   ⍝ execute OPER; on success (RC=2) RES is the value OPER returned
 →(RC≠2)/ERROR          ⍝ OPER itself failed (e.g. non-conforming random A/B)
 (RC2 ET2 RES2)←⎕EC EXPD     ⍝ evaluate the invariant; a plain expr gives RC=1 on success
 →(RC2≠1)/ERROR              ⍝ the constraint expression itself failed to evaluate
 →(RES2)/LOOP                ⍝ invariant holds: keep fuzzing
 ⍝ invariant violated here — falls through (handling TBD)
 →((24 60 60⊥⎕TS[4 5 6]) < T0 + B)/LOOP
 Z←1 ◊ →0
ERROR:
 ECNT←ECNT+1
 ON_ERROR ECNT A B X OPER   ⍝ dump a reproducer for each of the first 10 errors
 →(ECNT<10)/LOOP            ⍝ keep fuzzing until the 10th error
 Z←0
∇

      ALL_PRIMITIVES 5
1

      )CHECK BRIEF
